{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方的大字号文字，尤其是珊瑚红高亮的“自己需要对方”“不再藏起喜欢”；随后容易被第二块的金黄色高亮“顾不上害臊”“我不再为它道歉”吸引。第三块灰白色大字也较醒目。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他意识到自己需要对方，想坦然承认并表达喜欢；两人关系是否稳定、能否继续亲近，不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"大致是高兴、坦然、不再羞耻；是否还夹杂不安和心痛，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"即使对方不需要他，他仍愿意陪伴对方；以及未来能否继续亲近并不由他决定，欢喜中还夹着心痛。这层情绪转折主要在第三块。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"第一块和第二块都有大字号及高亮词，两个视觉重点争夺主视线。\",\n    \"独立的大字叙述块有三块，分别呈现关系认知、自我接纳和未来担忧，主线需要在几块之间建立联系。\",\n    \"单块长句包含多层意思，光看放大的关键词不足以准确判断人物处境和情绪关系。\",\n    \"中部歌词小字连续排列，需要在多行之间挑选信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "adf9385e-f316-4b58-b424-959c063cc2e1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T021843079927Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:19:29.035369+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8fb359ee025129650fcc12672fed53f780039a52483fb1b68394e965be8866cc", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt